{"4751910": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Goose On The Loose", "steam_appid": 4751910, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Some clown sent his minions to steal your golden egg.</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Honksworth is a bad egg with a worse gambling habit. He bet his golden egg and cracked under pressure. Now he's come for yours and the only way to get it back is through every minion he's got.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4751910/extras/5111be8834f0ffea774e6061b7e02f14.poster.avif?t=1786192921\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4751910/extras/5111be8834f0ffea774e6061b7e02f14.webm?t=1786192921\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4751910/extras/5111be8834f0ffea774e6061b7e02f14.mp4?t=1786192921\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Waddle. Spin. Honk. Defend.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight off endless waves of bees, slimes and mobs in a frantic 3D action-defense game. Spin-attack your way through swarms, launch mobs (and yourself) sky-high, and keep your egg alive as the chaos escalates wave after wave.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4751910/extras/21db0001fa18f2c2b613b16c2241bfe5.poster.avif?t=1786192921\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4751910/extras/21db0001fa18f2c2b613b16c2241bfe5.webm?t=1786192921\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4751910/extras/21db0001fa18f2c2b613b16c2241bfe5.mp4?t=1786192921\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build Your Battleground</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy new tiles to expand your island, then drop turrets and launch pads exactly where you need them. Every inch of land you claim is another angle the enemy can come from — plan accordingly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4751910/extras/5320f7713c32d73be8631c78c5e3ea14.poster.avif?t=1786192921\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4751910/extras/5320f7713c32d73be8631c78c5e3ea14.webm?t=1786192921\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4751910/extras/5320f7713c32d73be8631c78c5e3ea14.mp4?t=1786192921\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Eggs, Risks and Mayhem</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect eggs mid-run to trigger challenges, take on risks, or unleash events that change everything, timed objectives, world-bending gambles, and random chaos, all mid-fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4751910/extras/fb4f07a514dd90b406a1e7bb2f1d50a4.poster.avif?t=1786192921\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4751910/extras/fb4f07a514dd90b406a1e7bb2f1d50a4.webm?t=1786192921\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4751910/extras/fb4f07a514dd90b406a1e7bb2f1d50a4.mp4?t=1786192921\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Wet Your Beak</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend your coins on powerful drinks before each wave. Spin into a frenzy, drop a bomb, distract the whole mob, your choice shapes how the fight plays out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4751910/extras/2110eeb4f1e15b558aff605ad41df133.poster.avif?t=1786192921\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4751910/extras/2110eeb4f1e15b558aff605ad41df133.webm?t=1786192921\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4751910/extras/2110eeb4f1e15b558aff605ad41df133.mp4?t=1786192921\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Not Just Another Minion</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every so often, something bigger shows up, a mini-boss, a full swarm rush, or Honksworth's own herald trumpeting in something much, much worse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4751910/extras/073ad0be87902e3c47f6384e38ab8deb.poster.avif?t=1786192921\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4751910/extras/073ad0be87902e3c47f6384e38ab8deb.webm?t=1786192921\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4751910/extras/073ad0be87902e3c47f6384e38ab8deb.mp4?t=1786192921\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" 