ep your egg alive as the chaos escalates wave after wave.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4751910/extras/21db0001fa18f2c2b613b16c2241bfe5.poster.avif?t=1786192921\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4751910/extras/21db0001fa18f2c2b613b16c2241bfe5.webm?t=1786192921\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4751910/extras/21db0001fa18f2c2b613b16c2241bfe5.mp4?t=1786192921\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build Your Battleground</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy new tiles to expand your island, then drop turrets and launch pads exactly where you need them. Every inch of land you claim is another angle the enemy can come from — plan accordingly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4751910/extras/5320f7713c32d73be8631c78c5e3ea14.poster.avif?t=1786192921\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4751910/extras/5320f7713c32d73be8631c78c5e3ea14.webm?t=1786192921\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4751910/extras/5320f7713c32d73be8631c78c5e3ea14.mp4?t=1786192921\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Eggs, Risks and Mayhem</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect eggs mid-run to trigger challenges, take on risks, or unleash events that change everything, timed objectives, world-bending gambles, and random chaos, all mi